  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 54 + 18 ÷ 9 - 36 × 16 = 88\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the two signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷ and + \n\n54 + 18 ÷ 9 - 36 × 16 = 88 ⇒ **54 ÷ 18**__ + 9 - 36 × 16 = 88\n\n3 + 9 - __**36 × 16**__ = 88\n\n__**3 **____**+ 9**__ - 576 = 88\n\n__**12 - 576**__ = 88\n\n-564 ≠ 88 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : + and - \n\n54 + 18 ÷ 9 - 36 × 16 = 88 ⇒ 54 - **18 ÷ 9**__ + 36 × 16 = 88\n\n54 - 2 + __**36 × 16**__ = 88\n\n__**54 + 576**__ - 2 = 88 \n\n__**630 - 2**__ = 88\n\n628 ≠ 88 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : × and + \n\n54 + 18 ÷ 9 - 36 × 16 = 88 ⇒ 54 × **18 ÷ 9**__ - 36 + 16 = 88\n\n__**54 × **____2__ - 36 + 16 = 88\n\n__**108 + 16**__ - 36 = 88\n\n__**124 - 36**__ = 88\n\n**88 = 88 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ÷ and x \n\n54 + 18 ÷ 9 - 36 × 16 = 88 ⇒ 54 + 18 × 9 - **36 ÷ 16**__ = 88\n\n54 + __**18 × 9**__ - 2.25 = 88\n\n__**54 + 162**__ - 2.25 = 88\n\n__**216 - 2.25**__ = 88\n\n213.75 ≠ 88 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
